# Claude output (scratch: raw traces, one-off comparisons; may be purged)
claude-output/

# The startup tooling's machine-local root beside its committed records: the device-serial map, the raw
# members culled from evidence archives (logcat captures, rendered reports), run directories and rendered
# pages. Identifying or re-derivable, so never committed; kept out of claude-output/ on purpose so a
# scratch clean-up never deletes a machine's history.
.claude/skills/_shared/local/

# The startup tooling's committed records keep each campaign's log despite the *.log rule above, and so
# do the frozen test fixtures, whose golden inputs include a campaign's log verbatim.
!.claude/skills/_shared/records/**/*.log
!embrace-analysis-test-fixtures/fixtures/**/*.log

# One engineer's own device serials, hosts and app ids, for `tools/startup check-local-refs` to match by
# name. Never committed: the checked-in half of that tool describes the SHAPE of a local reference, this
# names it.
.local-refs-tokens
